@startuml kairos-view-forms-library-and-submit-sequence
title View Forms Library and Submit Form

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Open Forms Library
MemberApp -> API: GET /forms
API -> DB: SELECT forms
DB --> API: List
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {forms}

Member -> MemberApp: Select a form (e.g., New Believer)
MemberApp -> API: GET /forms/{id}/fields
API -> DB: SELECT fields
DB --> API: fields
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK

Member -> MemberApp: Fill form (smart/conditional)\nClick "Submit"
MemberApp -> API: POST /forms/{id}/submissions {answers}
API -> DB: INSERT FormSubmission + FormAnswers
DB --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 201 Created

MemberApp --> Member: Show success confirmation

@enduml
